{\b This is a test build, so things can break.}\par
\par
If you're seeing this, you're probably here to find out what broke.\par
\par
Kaye goes in your own user folder, so it doesn't need administrator rights. Your settings, API key and backups in %APPDATA%\\Kaye are never touched by installing, updating or removing Kaye.\par
